{"page_id": "olmo_old_scans-15-p1", "markdown": "CABLE ADDRESS, BUVALE\n\nTELEPHONE, MAIN 3928\n\n10 -\n\nMARION BUTLER\n\nBUTLER & VALE\n\nATTORNEYS AT LAW\n\nSOUTHERN BUILDING WASHINGTON,D.C.\n\nJ.M.VALE\n\nMay 22nd, 1914.\n\n# ack\n\nCol. Theo. Roosevelt, Oyster Bay, L. I.\n\nNew York.\n\nDear Mr. President,\n\nConfirming my telegram,\n\nMrs. Butler and I will be delighted to have you as our guest while you are in Washington next week, on the occasion of your lecture before the National Geographical Society.\n\nTrusting that we will have the\n\npleasure of entertaining you, and that your health is being rapidly restored, I am,\n\nVery sincerely yours,\n\nManau Pestio", "width": 5086, "height": 6605, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "CABLE ADDRESS, BUVALE", "bbox": {"x": 481.10810658078066, "y": 454.0937498725886, "width": 852.2486486486487, "height": 68.80208333333309}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TELEPHONE, MAIN 3928", "bbox": {"x": 3917.5945939072967, "y": 467.8541666073548, "width": 797.2648648648646, "height": 68.80208333333309}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "10 -", "bbox": {"x": 1319.6108097798647, "y": 1114.5937493119789, "width": 274.91891891891896, "height": 165.12500000000014}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MARION BUTLER", "bbox": {"x": 1965.6702695486078, "y": 811.8645831613278, "width": 508.6000000000002, "height": 68.80208333333383}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "BUTLER & VALE", "bbox": {"x": 2281.82702633973, "y": 949.468749910258, "width": 659.8054054054057, "height": 82.56250000000044}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ATTORNEYS AT LAW", "bbox": {"x": 2143.1037784057808, "y": 1045.1365758486972, "width": 923.1112904316669, "height": 95.00579838454738}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SOUTHERN BUILDING WASHINGTON,D.C.", "bbox": {"x": 2240.589188072331, "y": 1142.1145832252648, "width": 714.789189189189, "height": 165.1249999999994}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "J.M.VALE", "bbox": {"x": 2941.632431401487, "y": 811.8645829033205, "width": 302.4108108108105, "height": 68.80208333333309}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "May 22nd, 1914.", "bbox": {"x": 3213.9758910624946, "y": 1213.4640065308104, "width": 870.565180350639, "height": 154.58326386411974}}, {"kind": "heading", "text": "ack", "bbox": {"x": 2828.430514894412, "y": 1484.506118234603, "width": 612.9075061076398, "height": 353.72366122404776}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Col. Theo. Roosevelt, Oyster Bay, L. I.", "bbox": {"x": 1388.3405398917093, "y": 1843.8958332402883, "width": 1237.1351351351352, "height": 316.48958333333366}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "New York.", "bbox": {"x": 2047.605611570384, "y": 2212.4809072897524, "width": 509.68066635131845, "height": 102.21526824434632}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Dear Mr. President,", "bbox": {"x": 1372.984275543923, "y": 2389.847029767178, "width": 1090.1113406207112, "height": 143.56462638576846}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Confirming my telegram,", "bbox": {"x": 2374.703963035973, "y": 2580.6127385869636, "width": 1299.928829461175, "height": 173.9246899783614}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Mrs. Butler and I will be delighted to have you as our guest while you are in Washington next week, on the occasion of your lecture before the National Geographical Society.", "bbox": {"x": 1345.8607682733386, "y": 2775.32579093969, "width": 2491.5174094947606, "height": 722.0172942678129}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Trusting that we will have the", "bbox": {"x": 1896.9405395530446, "y": 3563.947916595492, "width": 1718.2432432432436, "height": 123.8437500000003}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "pleasure of entertaining you, and that your health is being rapidly restored, I am,", "bbox": {"x": 1290.5521213608909, "y": 3749.23114261919, "width": 2421.6220136487805, "height": 320.7110545436539}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Very sincerely yours,", "bbox": {"x": 2443.860525511701, "y": 4130.970987569627, "width": 1215.3396432825036, "height": 164.51866038143635}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Manau Pestio", "bbox": {"x": 2747.7600224032994, "y": 4376.089803863373, "width": 1789.291510669605, "height": 332.6101373831428}}], "ms": 324.9475}